  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Today**: rare: 12 archived performances [7]\n- **Cocaine Blues**: rare: 9 archived performances [7]\n- **Pyramid**: back after 75 archived shows (686 days); rare: 7 archived performances [7]\n- **Mama Tried**: rare: 4 archived performances [7]\n- **Friend of the Devil**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [7]\n- **Reynolds Wrap**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [7]\n- **'T' For Texas**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [7]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2021-12-04.AKG.ck63** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 144 min; rated 5/5 by 4 [1]\n- **billystrings2021-12-04.InsideOut_AKG.ck63**: source not stated; 26 songs; 144 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Paul Cauthen [1]\n- Reviewer describes one jam running nearly 23 minutes, an immersive highlight of the night [6]\n- Venue security at The Factory handled the taping politely, and a compromise was reached with the taper [1]\n- Venue security at The Factory handled the taping politely, and a compromise was reached with the taper [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2021-12-04.AKG.ck63**: taped by HealthCov Chris; transferred by InsideOut Recording; source: AKG ck63 (PAS) > Nbob actives > Naiant PFA > SD MixPre-6 [1]\n- **billystrings2021-12-04.InsideOut_AKG.ck63**: taped by HealthCov Chris; transferred by InsideOut Recording; source: AKG ck63 > Nbob actives > Naiant PFA > SD MixPre-6 [2]",
